{"title":"2024 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For some real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddde7dd752b934381ecdc777b24c5156bdfd3a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" />, the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/a/64a6d14146d6f478cc9e02137a25d8bcca8f04a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79ca8f1754cc91199db9309220537764258376c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5r^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7fbe7868a5ed0e5457143d402df54da9916bc58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5r^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" /> has the property that the second term plus the third term equals the square of the first term. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The second term added to the third term would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/5/6258e895a680c9eaa4f7c4e9c76da8246ae1ad91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5r^{2} + 5r^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The square of the first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61d94b5538e9e68f7f3df3769da8cd27ed8776ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5r)^{2} = 25r^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Setting these equal, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/3/ba3df2d62a833e18b13840be85d5eadcdb620a61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5r^{2} + 5r^{3} = 25r^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a6a1e3868a826b30a1ed08a62d20ac9486d3aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5r^{3} = 25r^{2} - 5r^{2} = 20r^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Dividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/1/401c04edfdfd90c0bb6df5f139123af487c14b7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5r^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" /> (since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddde7dd752b934381ecdc777b24c5156bdfd3a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" />), we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b7c2bc4773012ab3cd2ba92d311fd64a10180a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5r^{3}}{5r^{2}} = \\frac{20r^{2}}{5r^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be79bb0ee20302cd236aa0a64f20127954e285ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"55\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solution\">Verifying Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3d0ec5f2d7f35713345f0d9428d964fb6d4525f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, then the common ratio is also just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49c5626e8e4ea770014a1bfcb31b3d66e01e8fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 4 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />. This means that the second term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4b6215959466364c10cf967d530d39986cdf171.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\times 4 = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> and the third term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/1938741f3d574ed72b56c889109a8ed041d64cf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80 \\times 4 = 320$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of the second term and the third term would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce4d4a2ee96a2193fa4c898f372c9acc0660d989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80 + 320 = 400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>The square of the first term would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0dd663a80982da1a62f9d60f0abd18940a1250b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20^{2} = 400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>These are equal, so we have verified our answer.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025616\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 102/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3842/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.016      1 2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.016      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35992:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025616 and revision id 279591. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}